# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Everlook

step Everlook's inn
  when !bound "Ironforge"
  tip Your Hearthstone is not set at Ironforge (the Hinterlands guide binds there, and this guide leaves Winterspring through it): bind at Everlook instead, for the trips back to town.
  sethome "Everlook" npc 11118        -- Innkeeper Vizzie

step Everlook
  getfp "Everlook"
  accept 6028                         -- Gregor Greystone: keep it for the Plaguelands; inside
  accept 6030
  turnin 4808                         -- Felnok Steelspring
  accept 4809
  accept 6603                         -- Meggi Peppinrocker walks around Everlook: look inside the circle on the map
  accept 3783                         -- Umi Rumplesnicker

step Wynd Nightchaser
  turnin 5249                         -- Wynd Nightchaser
  accept 5244
  turnin 5244                         -- Jaron Stoneshaper
  accept 5245

step Donova Snowden
  tip Follow the road west to Donova's camp beside the hot springs.
  turnin 3908
  accept 3909                         -- Keep it: Gregan in Feralas brews the elixir later
  turnin 6603
  accept 5082

step Level 55 at Frostfire Hot Springs
  when level<55
  tip The western Winterfall camp sits in the hills between Salfa and Donova. Top up here first to level 55 on its Pathfinders (53-54) at the camp's edge: the Den Watchers inside are 55-56. Killing them raises your Timbermaw reputation and fills your bags with Runecloth for Meilosh. Or, with a group, run Blackrock Depths or Dire Maul instead.
  goto 31.4,36.0 map 1452 "Winterfall Pathfinder"
  level 55 grind 7442                  -- grind on Winterfall Pathfinder

step Frostfire Hot Springs: kill these as you meet them
  zone Winterspring
  tip Any furbolg here can drop an Empty Firewater Flask (about one in ten: it comes within the kills these quests need) and a Winterfall Ritual Totem (about one in thirty): right-click whichever drops. Keep the Runecloth the furbolgs drop for Meilosh.
  collect 12771                       -- Empty Firewater Flask
  accept 5083
  kill 7442 quest 5082.1              -- Winterfall Pathfinder
  kill 7440 quest 5082.2              -- Winterfall Den Watcher
  kill 7441 quest 5082.3              -- Winterfall Totemic
  kill 7440 quest 8464.2              -- Winterfall Den Watcher

step Donova Snowden
  turnin 5082
  turnin 5083
  accept 5084                         -- The Deadwood cauldron in Felwood: keep it

step Level 55.05
  when level<55.05
  tip Top up here to level 55.05 before the hand-ins at Everlook: they take you to level 56. Grind the Winterfall furbolgs camped by Frostfire Hot Springs (Pathfinders, Totemics, Den Watchers): killing them raises your Timbermaw reputation, which the quests here and the walk through Timbermaw Hold need, one of them drops the Winterfall Ritual Totem, and they fill your bags with the thirty Runecloth Meilosh asks for. Or, with a group, run Blackrock Depths or Dire Maul instead.
  goto 31.4,36.0 map 1452 "Winterfall Pathfinder"
  level 55.05 grind 7442               -- grind on Winterfall Pathfinder

step Winterfall Ritual Totem
  tip Any Winterfall furbolg can drop the totem, about one kill in thirty: if the top-up did not bring one, keep killing them here until it drops, then right-click it.
  goto 31.4,36.0 map 1452 "Winterfall Pathfinder"
  collect 20742                       -- Winterfall Ritual Totem
  accept 8471                         -- For Kernda in Timbermaw Hold: keep it

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East along the road, at 55

step The Ruins of Kel'Theril
  tip The ruins lie around the frozen lake south of Starfall Village. Pick up the four relic fragments lying in the ruins and the Moontouched Feathers on the ground where the wildkin roam.
  collect 12896 quest 5245.1          -- First Relic Fragment
  collect 12898 quest 5245.3          -- Third Relic Fragment
  collect 12899 quest 5245.4          -- Fourth Relic Fragment
  collect 12897 quest 5245.2          -- Second Relic Fragment
  collect 12383 quest 978.1           -- Moontouched Feather

step Ice Thistle Hills: kill these as you meet them
  zone Winterspring
  tip Ice Thistle yetis live in the hills south of Winterfall Village, Chillwind Chimaeras in the valley toward Everlook.
  tip Careful: the Ice Thistle Yetis are 55-56 and the Chimaeras 55-57: take the Rogue Ice Thistles (53-55) and the Fledgling Chillwinds (53-55) at the edge of the hills, and leave the Chillwind Ravagers (57-59) alone.
  collect 12366 quest 3783.1          -- Thick Yeti Fur
  collect 12444 quest 4809.1          -- Uncracked Chillwind Horn

step Everlook
  turnin 4809                         -- Felnok Steelspring
  turnin 3783                         -- Umi Rumplesnicker
  accept 977

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The east

