  tip Careful: hunt Ice Thistle Matriarchs (56-57) on the western edge of the hills. Leave the higher-level Patriarchs alone.
  collect 12367 quest 977.1 npc 7459 @65.88,43.57 map 1452 -- Loot the horns from Ice Thistle Matriarchs

step Everlook
  turnin 977
