step To Ironforge
  when bound "Ironforge"
  zone Ironforge
  tip Your Hearthstone is still set at Ironforge: from there the gryphon to Chillwind Camp is about ten minutes quicker than Everlook's flight to Theramore and the boat.
  goto 18.15,51.45 "Ironforge inn"

step Ironforge
  when bound "Ironforge"
  zone Ironforge
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock

step Laris Geardawdle
  when bound "Ironforge"
  when onquest 4512
  zone Ironforge
  tip Laris Geardawdle works in the Hall of Explorers: hand him Felwood's ooze jars now, on your way through.
  turnin 4512                         -- Laris Geardawdle
  accept 4513                         -- Its jars are filled on the Silithus guide's Un'Goro visit: keep it

step Fly to Chillwind Camp
